=== Nowcast Generation Script Ready ===

Key functions:
  - generate_nowcast() - Core nowcast generation with Kalman filter
  - calculate_confidence_intervals() - Uncertainty quantification
  - calculate_component_contributions() - GDP component breakdown
  - track_nowcast_evolution() - Track changes over quarter
  - calculate_data_release_impact() - Measure 'news' effect
  - run_complete_nowcast() - Complete workflow
  - save_nowcast_results() - Persist results

Outputs:
  - Point estimate of GDP growth
  - 68% and 95% confidence intervals
  - Component contributions (requires full component model)
  - Nowcast evolution time series
  - Data release impact attribution

